Comment: The application is linked against the LVGL based cp0_lvgl runtime of the
 CardputerZero launcher by M5Stack (Copyright M5Stack Technology CO LTD, MIT) and LVGL
 (Copyright LVGL Kft, MIT), which are part of the binary and are therefore listed in
 its Copyright field below. The map engine of cp0_lvgl (projection, MBTiles and PMTiles
 readers, the tile store, the online sources, the map widget; MIT, written for the
 CyberdeckZero Launcher) is compiled into this app only, and contains stb_image 2.30 by
 Sean Barrett (public domain or MIT, at the user's choice), built as a static part of
 the engine.
 .
 Loaded at run time when installed, not shipped: SQLite (libsqlite3.so.0, public
 domain) for MBTiles files and the viewing cache, and libcurl (libcurl.so.4, the curl
 licence, an MIT-style licence) for the online sources, with the system's CA
 certificates. The Montserrat font (SIL Open Font License 1.1) is read from the
 launcher's installation at run time, not shipped.
 .
 Map data is not part of the package. Imported maps are the user's own, under their
 own terms. The optional online sources (OpenTopoMap, Thunderforest, Geoapify) are
 switched off until the user switches them on and accepts the provider's terms; their
 map data and styles are credited in the app (About) and on the map itself: map data
 (c) OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), OpenTopoMap style (CC-BY-SA), Maps (c)
 Thunderforest, Powered by Geoapify, (c) OpenMapTiles.

